  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large paella pan over medium heat. Add chopped onions and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped fenugreek leaves and cook until wilted.",
    "Add diced tomatoes, chicken broth, saffron threads, turmeric, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add bay leaves and continue to simmer for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional fenugreek leaves if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
